==Battleground==
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**8 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Calamary]] spawns.
**4 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Random anti-Alien Labyrinth fodder combined with an anti-Alien Uber should win this easily.

